abstract: "First v2.0 release candidate of memoria.ia. It freezes the structural V2 baseline: structural text observation and read-only resolution, recurrence-sensitive associations, coexistence of competing observations, persistence and cold reopen through BDR, structural selectivity, and native/mobile ABI integration. The post-RC1 roadmap adds explicit addressed state, trajectories, attractor dynamics and no-LLM resolutive inference; those capabilities are not claimed by this candidate."
